(7777385, 1293290, 4008, '<td valign="top">
This is quite a free interpretation of the original (not emulated as close as possible).  The angles are different, the light is, the camera is, the flowers are. The original is much more clean. But what bothers me the most is the dirt around the lens opening.</td>', 'This is quite a free interpretation of the original (not emulated as close as possible).  The angles are different, the light is, the camera is, the flowers are. The original is much more clean. But what bothers me the most is the dirt around the lens opening.', '2025-02-28 04:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7777386, 1293257, 4008, '<td valign="top">
Nice soft female touch. It is less intense than the original. To get closer it would need more light in the eye, harsher shadows (less reflection from the left) and a closer square crop. Amazing how the hat is almost exactly the same as the other one in this challenge, the fold, the light spots, etc (except for one small damage).</td>', 'Nice soft female touch. It is less intense than the original. To get closer it would need more light in the eye, harsher shadows (less reflection from the left) and a closer square crop. Amazing how the hat is almost exactly the same as the other one in this challenge, the fold, the light spots, etc (except for one small damage).', '2025-02-28 04:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7777387, 1293119, 4008, '<td valign="top">
