(7777388, 1293195, 4008, '<td valign="top">
I found the original by IreneM. Your version has a very soft waxed feel to it. The reflections are better controlled in your version. Must have been hard with the reflective fork underneath. Still all those reflections "distort" the round shape of the tomato.</td>', 'I found the original by IreneM. Your version has a very soft waxed feel to it. The reflections are better controlled in your version. Must have been hard with the reflective fork underneath. Still all those reflections "distort" the round shape of the tomato.', '2025-02-28 05:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7777389, 1293186, 4008, '<td valign="top">
